の作成はできません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9289.27, "timestamp": "02:34:49", "text": "。 右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9294.389, "timestamp": "02:34:54", "text": "右。 現時点では、YouTubeの不変的な分野には、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9298.87, "timestamp": "02:34:58", "text": "クリッパー"}]